{
  "name": "Caregiver",
  "type": "ability",
  "img": "icons/svg/ice-aura.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> Training (1) and Expertise (1) in Medicine</p><p>You know how to correctly treat and bandage grievous wounds.</p><p>When you take a <strong>Long Rest</strong>, you can choose to spend some time treating an ally's wounds. Doing so requires the use of a healer's kit or other medical supplies.</p><p>When you perform this action, make a <strong>Mind (Medicine)</strong> check, and choose one of the listed DCs below. You must choose the DC <em>before</em> you make the check.</p><ul><li><p><strong>DC 4:1</strong></p><ul><li><p>The ally reduces their <strong>Wounds</strong> by an additional <strong>-1</strong>.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>DC 4:2</strong></p><ul><li><p>The ally reduces their <strong>Wounds</strong> by an additional <strong>-2</strong>.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>DC 4: 3</strong></p><ul><li><p>The ally reduces their <strong>Wounds</strong> by an additional <strong>-3</strong>.</p></li></ul></li></ul>",
